  "limits": [
    "Only the old exhibited fusion obstruction and its general local peak are joined here. No global confluence, termination, full finite mixed homotopy basis or complete pure-wire presentation is established.",
    "The previous eighteen-form classifier applies to the frozen old catalogue, not automatically to all competitors in the new catalogue. Relative projection reduces new comparison questions to old ones but does not solve missing old comparisons.",
    "The old higher basis still has unresolved structural/pure-wire coherence obligations. New generator families are parameterized and context-generated; no finite list of all ground typed cells is claimed.",
    "comparison_iff concerns existence of comparisons with constructive witnesses. The two transformations are not proved inverses on higher-cell syntax or an equivalence of all higher categorical structures.",
    "Support equality is equality of declared proof obligations, not minimal assumptions, measured re-verification effort or total checking time. Indexed MAC guard IDs may share an existing universally quantified security theorem.",
    "Four-constructor counts exclude boundary tracks, expanded paths, circuit/wire/context/guard payloads and shared libraries. Macro expansion can enlarge those payloads. No equal-information ordinary-proof total-cost separation is established.",
    "Formal inverse reverses equality-preserving proof rewrites, not stochastic execution. Joint repair compares two circuits in the updated model, not old and updated model distributions, and does not clone mutable live oracle executions.",
    "The existing MAC security bound, full state/trace and attack/query order are unchanged. Computational reduction implementations/resources, continuing native-machine contracts and new runtime bounds remain unconnected for this new layer."
  ],
